{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メリークリスマス イヴっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ白まふまふなかま～(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、名古屋にて個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、お礼を言わせてください＞_＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に\n有難うございます ＞_＜、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もおっ、ほんとにほんとに\n有難うございます（ ;  ; ）（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん一人一人に、しっかり\n頭をさげてお礼したいくらい、\n感謝です((｡´;ω;)｡´_ _))\nほんとに感謝です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね、久しぶりの握手に\nすっごくどきどきしてたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに話そうかなあ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか テフテフしてて\n自分のお誕生日なんてすっかり忘れてて\nそしたら色んな方がたくさん\nお誕生日をすごく祝ってくださって\nびっくりで、もお本当に\n嬉しくて......、嬉しすぎました (;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に愛をたくさん感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルになって良かったというか、\nこんなわたしを応援してくださって\nアイドルにしてくれて有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしも、\n愛してもいいですか...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照れ///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服 ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろっ！レースっ！ワンピースっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしのだいすき三原則！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、本日は京都にて\n全国握手会です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は寒いから、来られる方は\n気をつけてきてくださいねっ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/24/1311589/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/